ncies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "## Problem Description\nI'm trying to build the MAVSDK C++ library for Android by following the official guide **\"Building for Android\"**. After multiple attempts, the build consistently fails during the configuration of the `libmavlike` (libmavlink) dependency because CMake cannot find the `tinyxml2` package on my host system.\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. Check out the MAVSDK source code at tag `v3.15.0`.\n2. Set up the Android NDK environment as per the guide.\n3. Run the following CMake configuration command from the source root:\n\n```\ncmake \\\n    -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE=$ANDROID_NDK_HOME/build/cmake/android.toolchain.cmake \\\n    -DANDROID_ABI=arm64-v8a \\\n    -DANDROID_PLATFORM=android-28 \\\n    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n    -Bbuild/android \\\n    -S.\n```\n\n## Some Error Log\n```\nCMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:50 (find_package):\n  By not providing \"Findtinyxml2.cmake\" in CMAKE_MODULE_PATH this project has\n  asked CMake to find a package configuration file provided by \"tinyxml2\",\n  but CMake did not find one.\n\n  Could not find a package configuration file provided by \"tinyxml2\" with any\n  of the following names:\n\n    tinyxml2Config.cmake\n    tinyxml2-config.cmake\n\n  Add the installation prefix of \"tinyxml2\" to CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH or set\n  \"tinyxml2_DIR\" to a directory containing one of the above files.  If\n  \"tinyxml2\" provides a separate development package or SDK, be sure it has\n  been installed.\n\n-- Configuring incomplete, errors occurred!\ngmake[2]: *** [CMakeFiles/libmavlike.dir/build.make:92: libmavlike/src/libmavlike-stamp/libmavlike-configure] Error 1\ngmake[1]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:87: CMakeFiles/libmavlike.dir/all] Error 2\ngmake: *** [Makefile:91: all] Error 2\nCMake Error at third_party/cmake/build_target.cmake:53 (message):\n  /home/merlin/MAVSDK/build/android/third_party/libmavlike failed to build!\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\n  third_party/CMakeLists.txt:25 (build_target)\n\n-- Configuring incomplete, errors occurred!\n```\n\n## Environment Information\n* MAVSDK Version:v3.15.0\n* Host OS:Ubuntu 24.04 LTS\n* Android NDK Version:28.2.13676358\n* CMake Version:4.2.0\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2789/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2789/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4023355588", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2789#issuecomment-4023355588", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2789", "id": 4023355588, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s7vz4jE", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 